-- Parser cases for syntax the Cores don't parse yet, in broken.talk's format.
-- Only `bun tools/grammar/check.ts` reads this file, so the Cores' fixture
-- tests don't fail on it. Each case moves into broken.talk, or its source
-- into a sketch, when both Cores parse it.
-- case: a Clause Shape on a parameter
-- expect: parses
shape Invoice is {type: text, ...}
on handle inv is an Invoice where the type of inv is "x"
  return 1
end handle
-- case: Clause Shapes before Argument Labels
-- expect: parses
on move item is a text to place is a number
  return 1
end move
-- case: a Clause Shape after a Destructuring pattern and on a Fallback
-- expect: parses
shape Invoice is {amount: number, ...}
on handle {amount: a} is an Invoice
  return a
end handle
on any message m is a map
  return 1
end any message
-- case: `is not a` parses, and is the load error `negated shape`
-- expect: parses
on handle inv is not a text
  return 1
end handle
-- case: `is` after a parameter needs `a` or `an`
-- expect: unexpected token at 1:18
on handle inv is 3
  return 1
end handle
